<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστῐβής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στείβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>untrodden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					859
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>desert, pathless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					657
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πόρος,</span> of the sea,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arion
				1.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
					149
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not to be trodden, holy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					126
				</span></i>
			; rare in Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.8.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>leaving no track,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mesom.
					<u>Nem.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
